<div class="flex flex-col space-y-1 text-left pr-8">
<h2 id="radix-ID" class="text-lg font-semibold leading-6 text-foreground">Prompt para generar JSON compatible</h2>
<p id="radix-ID" class="text-[13px] leading-5 text-foreground-secondary">Copia esta plantilla en tu IA. Cambia cada bloque [MODIFICAR] antes de generar el archivo para importar.</p>
</div>
<div class="rounded-lg border border-status-warning/30 bg-status-warning-soft p-3 text-sm text-status-warning">Las partes entre <span class="font-semibold">[MODIFICAR]</span> son obligatorias. Si no hay circuito, elimina el bloque <span class="font-semibold">CIRCUIT</span>. Si hay varios ejercicios, duplica bloques <span class="font-semibold">EXERCISE</span>.</div>
<div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/20 p-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">El botón "Copiar con catálogo" incluirá 3 ejercicios cargados.</div>
<div class="grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-3">
<div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/20 p-3">
<p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Varios ejercicios sueltos</p>
<p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Repite un bloque kind "EXERCISE" dentro de items por cada ejercicio. No juntes varios nombres en exercise_name.</p>
</div>
<div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/20 p-3">
<p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Sin circuito</p>
<p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Elimina por completo el bloque kind "CIRCUIT". El array items queda solo con ejercicios sueltos.</p>
</div>
<div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/20 p-3">
<p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Con circuito</p>
<p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Incluye un bloque kind "CIRCUIT". Dentro de exercises pon cada ejercicio del circuito; rounds marca cuántas rondas se repite la lista.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid gap-3 lg:grid-cols-2">
<div class="space-y-2">
<p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Ejemplo sin circuito</p>
<pre class="max-h-64 overflow-auto rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/40 p-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-foreground">
<code>{
  "items": [
    {
      "kind": "EXERCISE",
      "exercise_name": "Sentadilla goblet",
      "sets": 3,
      "reps_or_duration": "10",
      "measure_type": "REPS",
      "target_value": 10,
      "target_rir": 2,
      "rest_seconds": 60
    },
    {
      "kind": "EXERCISE",
      "exercise_name": "Press banca",
      "sets": 4,
      "reps_or_duration": "8",
      "measure_type": "REPS",
      "target_value": 8,
      "target_rir": null,
      "rest_seconds": 90
    }
  ]
}</code>
</pre>
</div>
<div class="space-y-2">
<p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Ejemplo con circuito</p>
<pre class="max-h-64 overflow-auto rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/40 p-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-foreground">
<code>{
  "items": [
    {
      "kind": "CIRCUIT",
      "name": "Circuito final",
      "rounds": 3,
      "rest_between_rounds_seconds": 60,
      "exercises": [
        {
          "exercise_name": "Jumping jacks",
          "reps_or_duration": "30s",
          "measure_type": "SECONDS",
          "target_value": 30,
          "target_rir": null,
          "rest_seconds": 15
        },
        {
          "exercise_name": "Mountain climbers",
          "reps_or_duration": "20",
          "measure_type": "REPS",
          "target_value": 20,
          "target_rir": 3,
          "rest_seconds": 15
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}</code>
</pre>
</div>
